{"2546160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Envyus", "steam_appid": 2546160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/82efdfe674d85ce2b9be31c58cb11841.poster.avif?t=1775145462\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/82efdfe674d85ce2b9be31c58cb11841.webm?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/82efdfe674d85ce2b9be31c58cb11841.mp4?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kingdom is rotting from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After returning from a distant journey, King Grimsam falls to a mysterious illness — leaving the throne of Sephadel empty, and the realm on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far across the Storm Sea, an unknown plague wipes out entire villages in days.<br>In Tinegard, travelers vanish… and those who remain are no longer the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Baldric Lamarc</strong>, a former soldier sent to attend the king’s funeral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something goes terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now hunted, blamed, and alone, you must uncover the truth behind a spreading corruption — before it consumes everything… including you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/fad04a982fa934a63602ca415e8b3df7.poster.avif?t=1775145462\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/fad04a982fa934a63602ca415e8b3df7.webm?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/fad04a982fa934a63602ca415e8b3df7.mp4?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DARK FANTASY JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the province of <strong>Tinegard</strong>, a land filled with decaying settlements, hidden secrets, and growing fear.<br>Every step forward brings you closer to answers — and deeper into danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/5bec6c02854df21073ab4e3185d67f41.poster.avif?t=1775145462\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/5bec6c02854df21073ab4e3185d67f41.webm?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/5bec6c02854df21073ab4e3185d67f41.mp4?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR PATH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>main and side quests</strong> that shape your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>weapons, armor, and abilities through actions</strong>, not grinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> that demand attention and skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new regions as the world slowly opens before you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/d515e8f8521aca52667f219449d6525e.poster.avif?t=1775145462\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/d515e8f8521aca52667f219449d6525e.webm?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/d515e8f8521aca52667f219449d6525e.mp4?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE WORLD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>real-time combat</strong> against relentless enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare carefully — outside the cities, nothing is safe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources through <strong>fishing, mining, and farming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to survive… or to help others</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEEK THE TRUTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade the royal guard.<br>Follow the clues.<br>Piece together what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because the truth may be the only thing that can save or destroy you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/82efdfe674d85ce2b9be31c58cb11841.poster.avif?t=1775145462\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/82efdfe674d85ce2b9be31c58cb11841.webm?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/82efdfe674d85ce2b9be31c58cb11841.mp4?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kingdom is rotting from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After returning from a distant journey, King Grimsam falls to a mysterious illness — leaving the throne of Sephadel empty, and the realm on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far across the Storm Sea, an unknown plague wipes out entire villages in days.<br>In Tinegard, travelers vanish… and those who remain are no longer the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Baldric Lamarc</strong>, a former soldier sent to attend the king’s funeral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something goes terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now hunted, blamed, and alone, you must uncover the truth behind a spreading corruption — before it consumes everything… including you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/fad04a982fa934a63602ca415e8b3df7.poster.avif?t=1775145462\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/fad04a982fa934a63602ca415e8b3df7.webm?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/fad04a982fa934a63602ca415e8b3df7.mp4?t=1775145462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DARK FANTASY JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the province of <strong>Tinegard</strong>, a land filled with decaying settlements, hidden secrets, and growing fear.<br>Every step forward brings you closer to answers — and deeper into danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546160/extras/5bec6c02854df21073ab4e3185d67f41.poster.avif?t=1775145462\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st